<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">assemble-hollow-choir-staff</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Veyra's masterwork assembly. The finished piece is joined here from four
self-crafted components and its bulk stock. This recipe is taught by
commission, never discovered at the bench, and it demands that every
component be of your own making.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 65)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting_circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Conductor Core (x1), Choir-Focus Gems (x1),
               Hollowed Voice-Box (x1), Chorus-Shard (x1),
               Chrysalis Setting (x6), Mutation Catalyst (x4)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Learned:</ansi>     by commission from Veyra (not self-taught)

